  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "746ff8d00f800174",
      "translationZh": "我们发布了 VeriLoop E2，这是一个从 Qwen3.8-27B 后训练而来的 27B 模型，并附带了模型权重、评估证据以及从 BF16 到 IQ1_M 的 llama.cpp GGUF 阶梯。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ff70afe947caa9e",
      "translationZh": "该模型专注于代码智能体、数学、科学推理和长期可验证的问题解决。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad00468cc5d038be",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，我包含了模型端结果以及本地推理细节：后训练设置、完成的基准评估、量化测量、llama.cpp 验证、测试硬件以及科学推理演示。对于 GGUF，每个测量的低位比特层级都是直接从规范的 BF16 GGUF 构建的，针对相同的冻结 BF16 对数进行评估，并使用相同的配对保真度协议进行检查。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "12fd74b1f5176c86",
      "translationZh": "主模型：VeriLoop E2",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b75fb44ecd7373aa",
      "translationZh": "VeriLoop E2 使用 VeriLoop-Governed Recurrence (VGR)。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8cfad8165fc8349f",
      "translationZh": "生成和验证不应属于同一权威机构。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2a8238cd2e1df29",
      "translationZh": "模型提出、诊断、修订、搜索并重新规划。外部证据决定候选状态是否允许持续存在。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f374087b47fc15e3",
      "translationZh": "只有当受保护义务不倒退且至少一个证据维度严格改进时，候选状态才被确认。否则，保留已验证的现任状态，失败证据可以指导下一次提议。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "199bc68fb57bb4b7",
      "translationZh": "我们还在后训练期间使用这种结构：来自同一状态的提案可以通过外部验证分为进展、非进展、回归和完成，从而使状态转换质量成为监督，而无需模型自我判断。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ab6b2eafddd3a836",
      "translationZh": "最终的后训练混合数据包含 1,841,831 条记录，涵盖软件工程、代码代理轨迹、数学、科学推理和可验证的递归。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2afc927ca7985f06",
      "translationZh": "九项已完成的基准评估：",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d1d8dfce2844fb33",
      "translationZh": "终端基准测试 2.1 — 88.8%",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "58fab7c96d0b3101",
      "translationZh": "终端基准测试 3.0 — 29.7%",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ba54799fa7094373",
      "translationZh": "终端基准测试 4.0 — 37.9%",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f6a6cc0793a1e236",
      "translationZh": "我们还发布任务级别的评估证据，而不仅仅是汇总分数。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f2ea3926779d90a3",
      "translationZh": "对于使用 VeriLoop Harness 的评估，它提供了外部执行和证据治理层；E2 检查点仍然负责提案生成、问题抽象、路线选择、诊断和重新规划。我明确保留这一区别，因为基准测试活动和独立的本地运行时检查不是同一个测量指标。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "683f4172dfc5d82b",
      "translationZh": "Tier Main 大小缩减 vs BF16 PPL 比率 Mean KLD Same top-p",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "018da25907c2dca6",
      "translationZh": "阅读当前权衡的一种实用方法是：",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bd46630df4b08df5",
