    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7fefef949e5fc762",
      "translationZh": "log-PPL 相关性：99.62%",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f82d60ba465849b5",
      "translationZh": "一个重要的澄清：这并不是一个统一的 1-bit 模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00594a6debbebcb7",
      "translationZh": "IQ1_M 是一个刻意采用混合精度的产物：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce20aa426abc9fb5",
      "translationZh": "353 F32 + 1 IQ1_M + 2 IQ2_S + 64 Q4_K + 429 Q5_K + 2 Q6_K = 851 个张量",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e89cac327369f5ce",
      "translationZh": "从 IQ2_S 到 IQ1_M 的转换恰好改变了一个选定的张量：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c30a81ecbf156c76",
      "translationZh": "其余的受保护精度策略保持不变。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2bae46b997f8c712",
      "translationZh": "这使得 IQ1_M 仅比 IQ2_S 小 8.633 MiB，因此我们不会将这种增量差异描述为某种戏剧性的压缩突破。对我们来说更有趣的是，较低的内存占用点仍然处于冻结的质量包络线之内。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "881c291f833acf39",
      "translationZh": "PPL 比率：1.003191 vs 1.003457",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0b5d5dd7de6401a9",
      "translationZh": "相同的 top-p：95.870% vs 95.516%",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d8ac759cf411375e",
      "translationZh": "平均 KLD：0.014357 vs 0.014023",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fe6d0fcb459e0659",
      "translationZh": "均方根压差：3.691% 对比 3.679%",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bfa01559c6f5fee0",
      "translationZh": "因此，这些是相邻的权衡点，而非简单的“Q1 在所有方面都优于 Q2”的结论。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2d2aba985ca58540",
      "translationZh": "我们测试过的硬件",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "28ff783b3ab90a18",
      "translationZh": "此处报告的测量结果和运行时检查是在以下设备上执行的：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e77f9d4d4d5d5635",
      "translationZh": "这是我为本次发布直接测试的硬件。我并非将其作为最低要求，也不假设其他系统具有相同的吞吐量或内存行为。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
