    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8f66da380a8fd3e3",
      "translationZh": "所有量化层级都使用以下方式针对相同的冻结 BF16 参考值进行评估：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
